[1] Rank-one p-curvature on local p-jets R=F_p[z]/(z^p)
    pcurv_rank = rank((D+M_a)^p); naive_rank = rank(M_{a^p})
    The mismatch is the operator/carry lesson.
  zero                         pcurv=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0]      naive=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0]      mismatch=0/5
    reading: trivial finite monodromy
  constant_1                   pcurv=[3, 5, 7, 11, 13]    naive=[3, 5, 7, 11, 13]    mismatch=0/5
    reading: exp(z), non-algebraic
  one_over_1_minus_z           pcurv=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0]      naive=[3, 5, 7, 11, 13]    mismatch=5/5
    reading: (1-z)^-1, rational
  two_over_1_minus_z           pcurv=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0]      naive=[3, 5, 7, 11, 13]    mismatch=5/5
    reading: (1-z)^-2, rational
  one_over_1_minus_z_squared   pcurv=[3, 5, 7, 11, 13]    naive=[3, 5, 7, 11, 13]    mismatch=0/5
    reading: exp(1/(1-z)), non-algebraic
  z_over_1_minus_z             pcurv=[3, 5, 7, 11, 13]    naive=[0, 0, 0, 0, 0]      mismatch=5/5
    reading: exp(-z)/(1-z), non-algebraic

